  "title": "Pin codex model in osf.toml, drop model assertions from roster test",
  "summary": "This change adds an explicit `codex` model to the `[agents.models]` table in `osf.toml`, because codex's built-in default (gpt-6-astra) returned 401 against the review environment's API key. The roster test in `crates/osf/tests/reviewers.rs` is relaxed in the same commit: it still asserts the reviewer order (codex, claude, opencode) but no longer asserts which model each reviewer is pinned to, since model names churn every few weeks. Net effect: the reviewer roster is unchanged, but codex now runs on a named model instead of its own default.",
